      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹181 (vs ₹156 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹181 (up from ₹156 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹48.9b (up 9.4% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹5.33b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 8.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Auto Components industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 28% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
